This project is made publicly available so that others may inspect, study, and learn from its source code and design.

The source code may be viewed and analyzed for personal study, educational purposes, and understanding of the project's development techniques.

This license intentionally provides source availability without granting open-source rights.

Except where this license explicitly grants permission, access to this project does not grant permission to copy, modify, redistribute, publish, or create derivative works from the project.

